-- the normal form of a body, by the machine: run for at most k steps and read wire 0. The readback
-- is given the same count k: with a count known only when run, the whole expression then stays
-- stuck on k once, where a fixed small count would unfold the readback and copy the stuck run at
-- every branch (a definition's code is the quote of its value, with no sharing)
nk-nf : Nat → NkTm → NkTm
nk-nf k t = nk-quote k (nk-mem (nk-run k (nk-nf-start t))) #0
